Good morning

Thank you for sending the information relating to the termination of your N=
SERC grants.

I am in the process of verifying the expenses listed as outstanding commitm=
ents with our use of grants funds team. I will confirm some of them shortly=
.

However, I would like to point out that the travel expenses for the confere=
nce June 10-15 for yourself are NOT eligible. Travel and subsistence costs =
happening after the termination of a grant are ONLY eligible for students o=
