<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"FR-CA" style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-f=
areast-language:EN-US">Good morning<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"FR-CA" style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-f=
areast-language:EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">Thank you for sending the information relating to the termination o=
f your NSERC grants.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">I am in the process of verifying the expenses listed as outstanding=
 commitments with our use of grants funds team. I will confirm some of them=
 shortly.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">However, I would like to point out that the travel expenses for the=
 conference June 10-15 for yourself are NOT eligible. Travel and subsistenc=
e costs happening after the termination
 of a grant are ONLY eligible for students or postdocs, not for the grantee=
. Therefore, that expense must be removed from the F303.<o:p></o:p></span><=
/p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">Also note that the termination of your grants will be May 27, 2025 =
as pre-defined. However, it is not always possible for institutions to prov=
ide signed documents to NSERC at that
 date. Usually, they are submitted in the following month as they reconcile=
 the previous month. Therefore, we must be patient with the institution.<o:=
p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">Regards<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language=
:EN-US">Melanie<o:p></o:p></span></p>
